msgid ""
"One paper describing how to treat forces in molecular dynamics simulations "
"of biological macromolecules"
msgstr "Biological Macromolecules の MD における Forces の扱い方を説明する論文"

#. mermaid click tooltip
#: NAVIGATION.md:23
msgid ""
"A second paper describing how to treat forces in molecular dynamics "
"simulations of biological macromolecules"
msgstr "Biological Macromolecules の MD における Forces の扱い方を説明する2つ目の論文"

